  "prefLabel": "En 902.33 Standard net metering tariff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 902.33 “Standard net metering tariff” means the net energy metering tariff provisions as specified in RSA 362-A:9, as applicable to customer-generators receiving a utility net metering capacity allocation prior to September 1, 2017, and not in excess of the net metering cap applicable prior to commission adoption of the alternative net metering tariff.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
